<title>JAPAN: Nichiei Finance revises briefing time to 0030 GMT.</title>
<headline>Nichiei Finance revises briefing time to 0030 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nichiei Finance Co Ltd said that it had changed the starting time for its news conference to 9.30 a.m. (0030 GMT) on Tuesday from 8.30 a.m. (2330 GMT Monday).</p>
<p>Further information was not immediately available.</p>
